    description: "Per WI-vobiv-kivop investigation 2026-04-26 on cohort cohort-001/iter-001 (deep-20260425-210357): alertmanager has 50 external_symbol nodes with language='jsonnet'; prometheus has 63 (mix of jsonnet, dist/index.cjs, etc.). Jsonnet is a real templating language widely used by Grafana / Tanka / monitoring stacks; it has a tree-sitter grammar. The simplest fix is likely just adding 'jsonnet' to the known-language enum in the INV-nodij validator (and any other places that gate on a fixed language list). The boundary nodes themselves may be structurally correct; the validator is over-strict. Verify by inspecting a sample boundary node — if name and kind slots are clean, the only fix needed is the enum widening. Acceptance: alertmanager + prometheus's external_symbol nodes with language='jsonnet' STOP being flagged as INV-nodij violations in a future cohort. Tag: invariant_violation cleanup."  # cb95
